/v1/","context":{"app_id":4463520,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4463520-1846651706693258","game_id":"steam-4463520","kind":"announcement","title":"Play the Free Demo NOW during Steam Next Fest! 🎮🌾","summary":"Hello Moomin fans and Cozy Gamers!Steam Next Fest is live, and Moomin: Midsummer Madness is officially taking part! 🎉Our Free Demo is available to play RIGHT NOW!Step into a flood-filled Moominvalley, explore the mysterious floating theatre with Moomintroll and friends, and enjoy a peaceful, heartwarming adventure.✨ Demo Highlights:●Play through the entire Chapter 1●Relaxing atmosphere, beautiful artwork, and gentle soundscapes●No time limits—enjoy at your own pace!The full game releases on Nove","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T01:00:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693258","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4463520-1846651706672945","game_id":"steam-4463520","kind":"announcement","title":"Free Moomin: Midsummer Madness demo available from tomorrow on Steam for a limit","summary":"Thank you so much for supporting Moomin: Midsummer Madness!A free-to-play demo of the game will be available to download from tomorrow, Thursday the 15th of October!This demo features the same content from the version that was enjoyed by numerous gamers at the Tokyo Game Show 2026, and lets you play through the first of the games 6 chapters right away. This is a great opportunity to experience the many famous scenes that were faithfully reproduced with a deep love and respect for the original bo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T02:17:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706672945","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4463520-1845383656379396","game_id":"steam-4463520","kind":"announcement","title":"The making of Moomin: Midsummer Madness Vol.3","summary":"Welcome to the third part of our series of interviews with Crossbridge Game Studios, the team behind Moomin: Midsummer Madness!This time we will be looking into their love for the original book and the things they took special care with.Vol. 3: Love for the original book and where the most care was taken🎨 A warm and cheery feel like a familiar old picture bookA purely black-and-white art style was considered during the concept stages, but we soon realised that the Moomins world still felt vibran","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T01:00:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656379396","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4463520-1842212951295411","game_id":"steam-4463520","kind":"announcement","title":"Moomin: Midsummer Madness Hands-on Demo Event Report from Japan & Finland! 🎮","summary":"Thank you so much for all your enthusiasm for Moomin: Midsummer Madness!Today, we'd like to share a look back at the early hands-on demo events that were recently held in Japan and Finland.🌸 Demo events held in Japan & Finland!We hosted the world's very first hands-on demo events for members of the official Moomin Fan Club in Japan and Finland, giving them an exclusive first look at the game!Feedback from attendees at the event💬 \"I can't wait to see what happens next!\"💬 \"I was so moved by how fa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T01:07:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951295411","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4463520-1841579228667269","game_id":"steam-4463520","kind":"announcement","title":"Moomin: Midsummer Madness: Release on November 12th 2026 & coming to Gamescom!✨","summary":"／📢 Our game's much-awaited release date has finally been announced!✨＼Moomin: Midsummer Madness will be released on the 12th of November 2026!The whole team are looking forward to release day, when Moomin fans worldwide can enjoy a heartwarming adventure, brought to life with beautiful hand-drawn graphics that could have jumped straight from the pages of the original Moomins books.There's not long to wait now!Remember to wishlist the game and look forward to the 12th of November! ✨🎮🌎 Moomin: Mids","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-21T01:00:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228667269","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4463520-1840944183778322","game_id":"steam-4463520","kind":"announcement","title":"The making of Moomin: Midsummer Madness Vol.2","summary":"Welcome to the second of a series of interviews with Crossbridge Game Studios, the developers of Moomin: Midsummer Madness!This time round we will be asking why the team chose the book \"Moominsummer Madness\" as the setting for the game.ーーーVol.2: Why was Moominsummer Madness chosen to base the game on?I personally love swimming as much as the Moomin family do, and I really wanted to make a game where water played a big part in the setting. Swimming can sort of make you feel like you are flying th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-14T01:40:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183778322","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4463520-1840944183772836","game_id":"steam-4463520","kind":"announcement","title":"Moomin: Midsummer Madness is part of the Wholesome Games Celebration!","summary":"The Wholesome Games Celebration is officially live! ✨We’re thrilled to be featured in this year's lineup from August 6 - 13! 🍃 We can't wait to share this adventure with you! Wishlisting Moomin: Midsummer Madness on Steam is the best way to keep up with all the latest news as we get closer to release.Join Moomintroll and Little My in a playful point-and-click adventure inspired by Tove Jansson's classic, Moominsummer Madness. Explore a floating theatre, solve cozy puzzles, and enjoy hand-painted","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-12T02:34:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183772836","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4463520-1840310314348472","game_id":"steam-4463520","kind":"announcement","title":"A wonderful journey to Moominvalley begins in Autumn 2026!🍂","summary":"Thank you so much for following and supporting us!We know you have been waiting eagerly, so we are delighted to announce that Moomin: Midsummer Madness will be coming out in Autumn 2026!✨There will also be a special physical edition of the game released for Nintendo Switch™ and Nintendo Switch™1!It is only a short while to wait before you can set off on a heartwarming adventure together with Moomintroll, Little My and their friends and see Moominvalley brought to life with gorgeous hand-drawn ar","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-09T01:08:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314348472","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4463520-1840310314340563","game_id":"steam-4463520","kind":"announcement","title":"The making of Moomin: Midsummer Madness vol.1","summary":"Welcome to the start of a series of interviews with Crossbridge Game Studios, the developers of Moomin: Midsummer Madness!In this series we will be bringing you an exclusive, behind-the-scenes look at how they made the game so much fun.ーーーVol.1: The childhood dreams that went into making a Moomin gameAs part of the preparation for this interview, I talked to my colleague who created the original opportunity for the project, and I asked him why he wanted to make a Moomin game in the first place.H","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T01:21:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314340563","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4463520-1835236783569566","game_id":"steam-4463520","kind":"announcement","title":"On-site Report! Moomin: Midsummer Madness arrives at the Moomin Shop in Finland","summary":"Today we bring you some wonderful and exciting news from Finland! 🍃 The Moomin Shop flagship store \"Moomin Shop Esplanadi\" in Helsinki is currently showing a short video clip from Moomin: Midsummer Madness. 🎥✨ It brings us tears of joy that local people can now see the game...! 😭 We hope that everyone in Helsinki enjoys it! We still have more to show you, so don't forget to wishlist and watch out for more news on Moomin: Midsummer Madness coming soon! 👇","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-15T09:10:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783569566","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4463520-1834602721194194","game_id":"steam-4463520","kind":"announcement","title":"\"Moomin: Midsummer Madness\" was announced at Wholesome Direct 2026!","summary":"Welcome, new Moominfamily members! We're so happy to announce Moomin: Midsummer Madness today - a playfully curious Nordic adventure you're sure to cherish. In case you missed the reveal in Wholesome Direct, here's our announcement trailer: You play as Moomintroll and Little My on a journey to find their way home after a sudden flood sets all of the Moominvalley inhabitants adrift. Inspired by Tove Jansson's fantasy novel, Moominsummer Madness, this fully illustrated point-and-click adventure is","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-06T16:53:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721194194","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4463520":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:32:17Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:32:17Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4463520":"2026-10-26T02:32:17Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4463520":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:32:17Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:32:17Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5252270":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:32:17Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:32:17Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4463520","app_id":4463520,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:37Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"fd0394ac37dd6cad8a311dd81b764472b93ab861cf